Tue Sep 22 18:14:10 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- CVE-2026-93088: the disaggregated-diffusion orchestrator read
  pickles off an unauthenticated bound ZeroMQ socket, allowing
  arbitrary code execution; stop installing
  sglang/multimodal_gen/runtime/disaggregation (boo#1282323)
